I'll build this as a heading, a short intro, a progress bar starting at 0 of 10 reviewed, and a flashcard deck of ten vocabulary cards that flip on interaction.

<a2ui-json>
[
  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "createSurface": {
      "surfaceId": "vocab-flashcards",
      "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/d-t6.json"
    }
  },
  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "updateComponents": {
      "surfaceId": "vocab-flashcards",
      "components": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "component": "heading",
          "text": "Vocabulary Flashcards"
        },
        {
          "id": "intro",
          "component": "body",
          "text": "Flip each card to reveal its definition. Mark your progress as you work through all ten words."
        },
        {
          "id": "review-progress",
          "component": "progress_bar",
          "value": 0,
          "label": "Reviewed 0 of 10",
          "accent": "#4f46e5",
          "show_percent": "true",
          "caption": "Cards reviewed"
        },
        {
          "id": "vocab-deck",
          "component": "flashcard_deck",
          "accent": "#4f46e5",
          "label_front": "WORD",
          "label_back": "DEFINITION",
          "cards": [
            { "front": "Ephemeral", "back": "Lasting for a very short time." },
            { "front": "Ubiquitous", "back": "Present or found everywhere." },
            { "front": "Serendipity", "back": "The occurrence of happy discoveries by chance." },
            { "front": "Eloquent", "back": "Fluent, persuasive, and expressive in speech or writing." },
            { "front": "Resilient", "back": "Able to recover quickly from difficulties." },
            { "front": "Meticulous", "back": "Showing great attention to detail." },
            { "front": "Ambiguous", "back": "Open to more than one interpretation." },
            { "front": "Candid", "back": "Truthful and straightforward; frank." },
            { "front": "Pragmatic", "back": "Dealing with things sensibly and realistically." },
            { "front": "Lucid", "back": "Expressed clearly; easy to understand." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]
</a2ui-json>

The progress bar starts at 0 of 10. The catalog's `flashcard_deck` component doesn't report flip or review events back to the agent, so the count won't advance on its own. Updating it would require the client to send review events, or a follow-up `updateComponents` message with a new `value` and `label`.
